(text "Solar-powered temperature window / firmware cannot override" (at 20 18 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e17a7bfa-eeaa-51bf-b7a7-640ea230d5f5"))
(text "Sensing and comparators draw from SOLAR_P, not the battery. In darkness the\ncharge-enable pass transistor defaults OFF. Cold/absent NTC and shorted NTC inhibit.\nNominal comparator crossover: +5 C / +40 C, leaving margin inside 0...45 C." (at 20 24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7a8a89ad-e4c2-5eff-9993-cf65a413b51e"))
(text "Calculations and assembly" (at 25 242 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a3bd43d4-d6e5-52ff-9a02-259607756283"))
(text "100k NTC, B25/50=4200K; 1% R25 and B tolerance.\nReference ratios: 0.7369 cold / 0.33557 hot; resistors 0.1%.\nDividers fed by SOLAR_VALID, off below UV threshold.\nAt 4V: sensor 20uA at 25C, references 4.29uA; no battery divider current.\nTLV7031S improves offset to +/-8mV; 7mV typical hysteresis.\nTPS3839L30 inhibits below 2.63V solar; release delayed 200ms typical.\nSee temperature-analysis.md for tolerances and startup qualification." (at 25 248 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ea6451b7-f283-5685-911a-b8ef17223d04"))
